@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy Policy";
}

<div class="container py-5">
    <div class="row justify-content-center">
        <div class="col-lg-10">
            
            <div class="text-center mb-5">
                <h1 class="display-5 fw-bold text-primary">Privacy Policy</h1>
                <p class="text-muted">Last updated: January 25, 2026</p>
            </div>

            <div class="card shadow-sm border-0 mb-4">
                <div class="card-body p-4 p-md-5">
                    
                    <h4 class="fw-bold mb-3"><i class="bi bi-shield-check text-success me-2"></i> 1. Introduction</h4>
                    <p>
                        Welcome to <strong>LifePlanner System</strong>. We value your privacy and are committed to protecting your personal data. 
                        This privacy policy explains how we collect, use, and safeguard your information when you use our application to manage your tasks, notes, and life goals.
                    </p>

                    <hr class="my-4" />

                    <h4 class="fw-bold mb-3"><i class="bi bi-person-lines-fill text-info me-2"></i> 2. Information We Collect</h4>
                    <p>We collect the following types of information to provide and improve our service:</p>
                    <ul class="list-group list-group-flush mb-3">
                        <li class="list-group-item bg-transparent"><i class="bi bi-check2 text-primary me-2"></i> <strong>Account Data:</strong> Email address, username, full name, and encrypted password.</li>
                        <li class="list-group-item bg-transparent"><i class="bi bi-check2 text-primary me-2"></i> <strong>User Content:</strong> Data you input into the system, including To-Do items, Personal Notes, and Life Goals.</li>
                        <li class="list-group-item bg-transparent"><i class="bi bi-check2 text-primary me-2"></i> <strong>Usage Data:</strong> System logs, timestamps of creation and modification of records for audit purposes.</li>
                    </ul>

                    <hr class="my-4" />

                    <h4 class="fw-bold mb-3"><i class="bi bi-hdd-network text-warning me-2"></i> 3. How We Use Your Data</h4>
                    <p>Your data is used strictly for the following purposes:</p>
                    <ul>
                        <li>To provide and maintain the LifePlanner service.</li>
                        <li>To authenticate your identity and prevent unauthorized access.</li>
                        <li>To allow system administrators to manage user accounts and ensure system integrity.</li>
                        <li>To display your personal progress on tasks and goals.</li>
                    </ul>

                    <hr class="my-4" />

                    <h4 class="fw-bold mb-3"><i class="bi bi-lock-fill text-danger me-2"></i> 4. Data Security</h4>
                    <p>
                        We implement industry-standard security measures to protect your data. Your passwords are never stored in plain text; 
                        they are hashed and salted using secure algorithms (ASP.NET Core Identity). Access to your personal notes and tasks 
                        is restricted to your account and authorized system administrators.
                    </p>

                    <hr class="my-4" />

                    <h4 class="fw-bold mb-3"><i class="bi bi-cookie text-secondary me-2"></i> 5. Cookies</h4>
                    <p>
                        We use essential cookies solely for authentication purposes. These cookies allow you to remain logged in 
                        as you navigate between pages. We do not use tracking or advertising cookies.
                    </p>

                    <hr class="my-4" />

                    <h4 class="fw-bold mb-3"><i class="bi bi-envelope-paper-fill text-primary me-2"></i> 6. Contact Us</h4>
                    <p>
                        If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy, please contact the administration team:
                    </p>
                    <div class="alert alert-light border">
                        <strong>Email:</strong> support@lifeplanner.com<br>
                        <strong>Address:</strong> LifePlanner HQ, Pristina, Kosovo
                    </div>

                </div>
            </div>

        </div>
    </div>
</div>